*.dvi

# --- editor temp files ---
*.swp
*~

# NOTE: *.pdf is deliberately NOT ignored — your literature PDFs are content you want tracked.
# To skip ONLY the compiled thesis output, add it by exact name, e.g.:
#   main.pdf